curious. Again, we're not playing games,

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:31.400
but we're simply understanding our

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:33.240
attention span and that it is drawn to

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:35.200
gaps. So these techniques I'm going to

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:36.960
tell you about, these fundamental

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:38.680
pillars, will basically change the way

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:40.640
you approach everything if you want to

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:42.440
be magnetic. The most immediate and

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:44.480
