00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:19.560
being like, "Oh, I work at this company.

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:21.080
I've been there for 5 years now. I

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:22.480
started in this role. Now I do this. I

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:24.480
