00:09:24.480 --> 00:09:28.000
you just say, "I'm in sales." That's it.

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:29.760
And now they're curious like, "Oh, what

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:31.200
kind of sales?" You can say something

