you're just being withdrawn and there's

00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:56.240
a fundamental energetic difference

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:58.080
between someone who chooses not to say

00:19:56.240 --> 00:20:00.360
something versus someone who's afraid to

