you're painfully shy, I've been there,

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:05.800
we can work on building our

00:20:03.880 --> 00:20:07.400
relationships with ourself first until

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:09.640
you can trust that what you have to say

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:12.120
really matters even if you choose not to

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:13.840
say it because trust me, it really does

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:15.120
