00:20:13.840 --> 00:20:16.520
are also a lot of people out there who

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:18.400
are just saying anything and they don't

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:20.240
sound very smart either. Number two, you

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:21.800
need to actually be interesting. I've

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:23.600
said this before and I'll say it again,

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:25.760
mystery only works when there's

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:27.320
substance behind it. If someone gets

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:28.520
curious about you and they realize that

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:30.240
there's nothing beyond that curtain,

