then you're just empty. So go out there,

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:33.840
experience the world and develop

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:35.400
opinions through actual thoughts that

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:37.320
you come up with, not just consuming

